{"id":"e66fa0a2ff4a679f","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-compactness.md","title":"Compactness Theorem","display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-compactness","aliases":["88-thm-compactness"],"display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-compactness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3514d680592de1bd\" href=\"?note=3514d680592de1bd\" title=\"88-df-compactness\">88-df-compactness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> (candidate set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-sentences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (compactness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3514d680592de1bd\" href=\"?note=3514d680592de1bd\" title=\"88-df-compactness\">88-df-compactness</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness} \\vdash\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness} \\vdash\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>展开谓词即：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>的每个有限子集都在某个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构中可满足，\n则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>可满足。</li>\n<li>该陈述不依赖抽象证明规则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，因此不会把紧致性误写成某个未指定演算的性质。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"3514d680592de1bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"3514d680592de1bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Gamma)$ (compactness predicate, see [[88-df-compactness]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness} \\vdash\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\to\\mathrm{Compact}_S(\\Gamma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":787,"backlinks":[{"id":"35fe1ee97b4ca429","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"紧致性定理的一阶逻辑形式 (see [[88-thm-compactness]])"},{"id":"96e88157ef117acf","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"紧致性定理应用 (see [[88-thm-compactness]])"},{"id":"3bc949095b085182","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"带参数公式与满足关系见 [[88-df-formula]]、[[88-df-satisfaction]]；证明使用 [[88-thm-compactness]] 和 [[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem]]。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","ancho